  "body": "I noticed that while investigating a crash in Blink, dialog becomes an inline when overriding the position:\r\n\r\n<dialog style=\"position:relative\">\r\n\r\nIt's originally a block since position:absolute causes blockification. That is in line with the currently specified UA style. Is that intentional, or should the UA style also contain display:block?\r\n",
